2026-07-27T08:22:08.4904553Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4905344Z i /tmp/RtmpHrxf5U/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4905874Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4906484Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4907334Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4908250Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4909477Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:22:08.4910431Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:22:08.5156138Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
